          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "शहाणा — śahāṇā — \"sensible; wise\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "शहाणी मुलगी आईला कामात मदत करते. śahāṇī mulgī āīlā kāmāt madat karte. The sensible girl helps her mother with the work."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Agrees: शहाणा (śahāṇā), शहाणी, शहाणं. शहाणं बाळ, a good baby."
            }
          ]
        },
